# StackLeo Tech Store — Docker build-context exclusions
#
# Applies to every `docker build` in this repo (all Dockerfiles build
# from the monorepo root context). Keeps the build context small and,
# more importantly, keeps real secrets out of it entirely — the `dev`/
# `builder` stages in apps/*/Dockerfile run `COPY . .`, so anything not
# excluded here is a candidate for ending up inside an image layer.

# Dependencies (reinstalled inside the image; never copy the host's)
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
.pnp
.pnp.js

# Build outputs (regenerated inside the image)
dist/
build/
.next/
out/
coverage/
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Environment files — never bake real secrets into an image; runtime
# config is injected via `env_file`/`environment` in docker-compose.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.env.staging
.env.production
!.env.example
!.env.*.example

# Version control / editor / OS noise
.git/
.github/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp

# Logs
logs/
*.log

# Turborepo / Vercel local caches
.turbo/
.vercel/

# Documentation — never needed inside a runtime image
docs/
README.md
**/README.md
